{"text":"purananuru","n":295,"lines":["கடல்கிளர்ந் தன்ன கட்டூர் நாப்பண்","வெந்துவாய் மடித்து வேல்தலைப் பெயரித்","தோடுஉகைத்து எழுதரூஉ துரந்துஎறி ஞாட்பின்","வருபடை போழ்ந்து வாய்ப்பட விலங்கி","இடைப்படை அழுவத்துச் சிதைந்து வேறாகிய","சிறப்புடை யாளன் மாண்புகண் டருவி","வாடுமலை ஊறிச் சுரந்தன","ஓடாப் பூட்கை விடலை தாய்க்கே"],"tr":["kaṭalkiḷarn taṉṉa kaṭṭūr nāppaṇ","ventuvāy maṭittu vēltalaip peyarit","tōṭuukaittu eḻutarūu turantueṟi ñāṭpiṉ","varupaṭai pōḻntu vāyppaṭa vilaṅki","iṭaippaṭai aḻuvattuc citaintu vēṟākiya","ciṟappuṭai yāḷaṉ māṇpukaṇ ṭaruvi","vāṭumalai ūṟic curantaṉa","ōṭāp pūṭkai viṭalai tāykkē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"tumpai","tinai_ta":"தும்பை","turai_ta":"உவகைக் கலுழ்ச்சி","poet_ta":"ஔவையார்","poet_tr":"Auvaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"8 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"8×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 30, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 19, veṇṭaḷai 10, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கடல்கிளர்ந்","tr":"kaṭalkiḷarn","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடல்","tr":"kaṭal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிளர்ந்","tr":"kiḷarn"}]},{"text":"தன்ன","tr":"taṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"கட்டூர்","tr":"kaṭṭūr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கட்","tr":"kaṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டூர்","tr":"ṭūr"}]},{"text":"நாப்பண்","tr":"nāppaṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாப்","tr":"nāp"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பண்","tr":"paṇ"}]}],[{"text":"வெந்துவாய்","tr":"ventuvāy","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெந்","tr":"ven"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துவாய்","tr":"tuvāy"}]},{"text":"மடித்து","tr":"maṭittu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மடித்","tr":"maṭit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"வேல்தலைப்","tr":"vēltalaip","f